    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 103,
        "endIndex": 471,
        "text": "### **Candidate [11] Anthropic formalizes Fermat's Last Theorem in Lean**\n* **What is confirmed:** Anthropic released a research paper on September 4, 2026, announcing that its Claude model worked largely autonomously over 11 days using the *Prove2Me* platform to formalize a complete, computer-checked proof of Fermat’s Last Theorem in the Lean programming language"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 473,
        "endIndex": 600,
        "text": "Independent mathematicians (including Kevin Buzzard at Imperial College) corroborated the complete computer-verified repository"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        1,
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 602,
        "endIndex": 825,
        "text": "* **Important caveats:** Formalization translates an existing human-written mathematical proof (the 1995 Wiles / Darmon–Diamond–Taylor proof) into machine-verifiable code; it is not a newly discovered mathematical proof"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        1,
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 939,
        "endIndex": 1158,
        "text": "### **Candidate [13] OpenAI launches GPT-6 Astra flagship model**\n* **What is confirmed:** OpenAI publicly released its newest flagship model, GPT-6 Astra, on September 3–4, 2026, across ChatGPT paid tiers and the API"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        3,
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 1160,
        "endIndex": 1276,
        "text": "The model introduces major advancements in autonomous computer use, software engineering, science, and coding agents"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        4,
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 1278,
        "endIndex": 1468,
        "text": "* **Important caveats:** OpenAI has gated certain advanced cybersecurity and exploit-creation capabilities behind its \"Daybreak\" access program due to crossing critical capability thresholds"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        6,
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 1470,
        "endIndex": 1567,
        "text": "Top performance scores on benchmarks like ARC-AGI-3 depend on specific stateful testing harnesses"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 1660,
        "endIndex": 2024,
        "text": "### **Candidate [5] Anthropic IPO prospectus delayed to late September (Reuters)**\n* **What is confirmed:** Reuters (reporting by Echo Wang) confirmed on September 4, 2026, that Anthropic has shifted its target timeline for releasing its public IPO prospectus to late September, aiming for marketing in mid-October and a stock market listing in early November 2026"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        8
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 2026,
        "endIndex": 2094,
        "text": "Anthropic is also finalizing a $15 billion revolving credit facility"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        8
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
        "startIndex": 2096,
        "endIndex": 2183,
        "text": "* **Important caveats:** Reporting relies on anonymous sources familiar with the matter"
      },
      "groundingChunkIndices": [
        8
      ]
    },
    {
      "segment": {
